.TH "Docv::CrystalPages::Inline" "3cr" "2026-11-03" "docv 0.1.0" "docv API Reference"
.SH "NAME"
Docv::CrystalPages::Inline \- Renders the inline content of a markd node as roff: code spans, emphasis, links, images and line breaks.
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
.nf
\fBrequire "docv/cli"\fR
.sp
\fBclass Docv::CrystalPages::Inline\fR
.fi
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
.PP
Renders the inline content of a markd node as roff: code spans,
emphasis, links, images and line breaks.
.SH "CONSTANTS"
.TP 4
\fBFONTS\fR
.RS
.PP
.RS 4
.EX
FONTS = {
  {false, false} => "\e\efR",
  {true, false} => "\e\efB",
  {false, true} => "\e\efI",
  {true, true} => "\e\ef(BI",
}
.EE
.RE
.RE
.SH "CONSTRUCTORS"
.PP
\fBdef self.new(io : IO, bold : Bool, urls : Bool, upcase : Bool, first : String | Nil)\fR
.SH "CLASS METHODS"
.TP 4
\fBdef self.markdown(text : String, *, urls : Bool = true) : String\fR
Roff for the first block of Markdown \fItext\fR, inline only.
.TP 4
\fBdef self.render(node : Markd::Node, *, bold : Bool = false, urls : Bool = true, upcase : Bool = false, first : String | Nil = nil) : String\fR
Roff for the inline children of \fInode\fR. \fIbold\fR sets the base font,
\fIurls\fR appends external link targets, \fIupcase\fR capitalizes
everything outside code spans, and \fIfirst\fR replaces the text of the
first text node.
.SH "INSTANCE METHODS"
.PP
\fBdef children(node : Markd::Node) : Nil\fR
